{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>啟德簡約公屋兩歲女嬰暈倒家中 母親急報警 (資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>啟德簡約公屋有女嬰暈倒。 今日（21日）早上7時35分，啟德世運道20號簡約公屋一名兩歲女嬰暈倒，其母親發現後連忙報警求助。警方和救護員接報後趕至現場，將女嬰送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救，女嬰其後轉醒。警方列作「病人」案件調查。據了解，女嬰身患疾病。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:20:06.709660+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T03:16:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T06:58:00.098432+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:17:47.341412+00:00","content_hash":"9ac61998f9ceee3ffc7a09773d1d128209f12365b2dea97f56b229f18526e911","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}